# Project scope — README is the source of truth

- Treat **`README.md`** (repo root) as the authoritative definition of the project **goal** and **scope**.
- Before proposing features, architecture, or large changes, check that they align with the README.
- If work would expand beyond the README scope, call that out and ask before proceeding.
- Prefer the README over assumptions from folder names, notebook titles, or prior chat when those conflict.
